WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.415
An island without people, and an island full of them.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.324
Surtsey has no inhabitants, but it holds a special place in Icelandic culture:

00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:12.880
a national laboratory and a symbol of a land still being made.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.952
Next door, Heimaey's culture is tied to the sea and the seabird cliffs.

00:00:16.952 --> 00:00:21.139
Each August, children rescue young puffins drawn into town by the lights.

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:27.469
In Grydehøj's terms, Surtsey is almost pure locus, a place where research happens.

00:00:27.469 --> 00:00:32.316
Heimaey is focus: an island community with its own story and its own stakes.
